{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Set up a nationally accessible portal for Domestic Violence commissioned support",
        "additional_details": "I have been working at a domestic abuse charity and have noticed that  each local area does not necessarily have a referral form which means people are then having to share their experiences over the phone again which is not good trauma-informed practice.",
        "background": "We want the Government to establish as nationally accessible portal which uses a universal form by which victims/survivors and professionals can help access or refer commissioned domestic abuse support.",
